WEBVTT

NOTE Captions derived from Descript audio-aligned transcript ticks, approximately five seconds; short cards merged within chapters.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
Welcome to Pivotglass version zero point nine point nine. This
edited

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
walkthrough uses real screens from an isolated, synthetic
investigation. No live

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
intelligence service or language model is required. The cockpit
brings questions,

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.840 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
evidence, alternative explanations, and analyst decisions into
one workspace.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
Novice mode starts with a conversation. What data do you have?
What happened?

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
The question coach helps a new analyst describe the source, the
observed event, and

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
the decision the investigation needs to support. Coaching is a
practice aid,

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.880 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
not a substitute for evidence.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:40.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
Do you know how it started? Here the analyst

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
explicitly says no. That unknown remains visible. Useful

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.200 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
analysis does not fill a missing origin story with a confident
guess.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:55.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
The coach proposes investigative questions. The analyst edits a
question to ask what

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
independent evidence distinguishes common control from shared
hosting. Saving is

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.520 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
an explicit decision; a draft becomes a durable question only
after review.

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:10.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
A short reflection records what the analyst practiced. Repeated

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:15.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
work builds habits: state the decision, separate observations
from

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:20.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
assumptions, and identify evidence that could change the
conclusion. Practice history

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:24.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
records participation, not a certification of expertise.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
The analytical

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:30.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
workbench keeps competing hypotheses and contradictory evidence
visible.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
Structured techniques help the analyst challenge a favored
explanation. A

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:40.640 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
contradiction is something to investigate and disposition,
rather than hide to make a cleaner narrative.

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:45.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
The constellation is a navigation aid for the admitted evidence.
It

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:50.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
helps locate objects and gaps. Position and visual emphasis do
not

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.760 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
establish adversary ownership, confidence, or importance.

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:55.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
Open an indicator

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:00.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
to inspect its complete value and stored relationships. In this
synthetic

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
case, a file communicates with a domain. A relationship supports
a specific

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:09.680 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
observation; it does not, by itself, establish common control.

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:15.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
The detail view exposes provenance and collection history.
Source identifiers,

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:20.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
timestamps, response hashes, and conflicting results let another
analyst

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:25.520 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
examine where an observation came from. A model summary is not
the original source.

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:30.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
Local document intake first previews candidates. This synthetic

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:35.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
document contains a domain and a deliberately long URL. The

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:40.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
analyst selects both, then explicitly admits the source and
candidates.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:43.120 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
Previewing alone does not add evidence to the workspace.

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:45.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
The source library retains the

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:50.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
admitted document and its digest. After restarting the isolated
service,

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:55.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
the same source and admitted objects remain available. Keeping
source material makes

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.360 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
review and later correction possible.

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:00.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
Provenance history shows the actual workflow:

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:05.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
document admission, creation of an analyst promotion group, and
two

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:10.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
candidate admissions. The branches record the analyst decision
to promote these candidates

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:15.280 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
together. They do not assert a shared adversary or an observed
threat relationship.

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:20.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
The relationship graph now shows seven nodes and five visible
edges.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:25.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
Stored relationships use their own edge style; analyst grouping
uses dotted

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:30.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
yellow edges. The long URL wraps inside its label. The

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.840 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
analyst can read the complete value and distinguish grouping
from evidence.

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:35.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
The analyst records

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:40.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
an explicit evidence link with a rationale. Here, a synthetic

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:45.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
observation supports the shared hosting alternative without
establishing control. The ledger

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:50.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
stores the link as an analyst judgment, preserving the
observation and the competing

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:50.800 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
hypothesis.

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:55.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
Generate a deterministic report from the current workspace. The

00:03:55.000 --> 00:04:00.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
report retains the investigative questions, alternative
explanations, explicit evidence

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:05.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
links, unresolved contradictions, and next collection
requirements. It

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:10.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
is a handoff for review, not an automatic verdict. The analyst
still

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:15.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
checks the assessment, limitations, and handling before sharing.
Choose

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:20.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
Save Markdown for the complete editable report, or Print and
Save PDF for a

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.040 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
printable copy.

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:25.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
Configuration separates optional intelligence and model services

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:30.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
from the local workflow. Enable providers deliberately and
understand their

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:35.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
network and data boundaries. The implementation and operations
guides

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:40.080 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
document prerequisites, backup, restore, maintenance, and
failure recovery.

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:45.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
Personas and themes give the workspace a distinctive atmosphere.
This is the

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:50.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
Nightgrid presentation. Visuals and optional sound help the
working

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:55.000 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
experience; neither changes evidence or analytical authority.
Start with the

00:04:55.000 --> 00:05:00.160 line:95% position:50% align:center size:95%
offline quickstart, then follow the user guide through a
reviewed, defensible handoff.
